    "description": "<p>Avenor Testaments favour open hands, broken chains, shelters, vessels and repeated phrases associated with preservation and relief. The script is often concentrated around the palms, forearms and heart.<br>Avenor are traditionally associated with healing, diplomacy and sanctuary. Many feel a strong emotional response to suffering even when they possess no formal medical training. Their communities often remind them that mercy does not require endless self-sacrifice; one of the most common dangers facing young Avenor is allowing other people to turn compassion into obligation.<br>You gain a +1 racial bonus to Medicine checks and gain Stabilize as a divinity innate cantrip with the Focus trait.</p>",
